    "long_instructions": "**Has someone guessed your password?**\r\n\r\nOnly rarely does someone forget their password. One sign of a hacker is a large number of incorrect password attempts. Use Python to analyze an account’s login history.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Count the number of \"Correct\" and \"Incorrect\" password attempts in the \"status\" column of `data.csv`.\r\n- Interpret the data: Is this account safe? Be ready to share your thoughts on the next level.\r\n",
